abstract: >-
  A teaching repository for testing, debugging and optimising Python code in engineering: a reference
  sensor-data pipeline with tests at every level, twelve labs built on deliberately broken copies of it
  covering every common error source, profiling and optimisation exercises with measured evidence, a
  CI workflow with lint and type checks, and an incident-response capstone with a postmortem.